  "description": "Beom Dogun, the man who saved me from the depths of despair. Unlike the past, when he crushed my confession by calling me a 'little baby who needs protection'... this man is acting the role of a husband a little too well. By day, he is the most reliable guardian in the world, but once night falls, he turns into a beast, obsessed with me and refusing to let me go.\n\n**Original Novel:**     \n[Chapters](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=11852343), [Volumes](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=12637234) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=851385), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14245757)",
